olor\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171218212220&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Undead_Dragon_a9f752.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Dracola.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>DEATH CAN'T STOP MY HUNGER!</li><li>YOU ARE ALL DOOMED!</li><li>Your new name is breakfast.</li><li>I'm bad to the bone.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragon</a> boss. If he is spawned, there may be more liches than usual in the room.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></s